# Ship the pre-seeded database (packs, KPI data, pre-provisioned accounts)
# and the machine key, so every container starts from the same state and
# can decrypt model API keys stored in that database. WAL side files and
# generated reports stay out: SQLite recreates them on first write.
data/onti.db-wal
data/onti.db-shm
data/reports
